{"ancestors": "0,9015970", "bizKey": "9015979", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-07-12 15:53:23", "detail": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>【题材产业链动态】</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 48, 75); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong>2024年6月4日</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 48, 75); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">国内商品期市开盘多数上涨，合成橡胶涨超7%，20号胶涨超5%，橡胶、沪银涨超4%</span><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 48, 75); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong>。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 48, 75); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong>2024年5月28日</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 48, 75); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">20号橡胶期货主力合约涨幅扩大超4%</span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>【题材基本面介绍】</strong></p><p>我国是全球最大橡胶助剂生产国。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/12/318a0788-5387-47b0-bc65-868b08d0a712-1689148348723.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 412.00px;height: 288.58px;\"/></p><p>防老剂、促进剂、加工助剂为三大主流产品。防老剂、促进剂、加工助剂是我国橡胶助剂市场的三大主流产品，2022年产量合计占我国橡胶助剂总产量的76.5%。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/12/a4ba38c2-d52a-4a7a-b46c-b2925af6face-1689148397005.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 417.00px;height: 268.79px;\"/></p><p><br></p>", "firstLetter": "XJZJ", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 2, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "橡胶助剂", "parentId": 9015970, "pctChg": 0.15, "reason": "国内商品期市开盘多数上涨，合成橡胶涨超7%，20号胶涨超5%，橡胶、沪银涨超4%。", "remark": "", "sort": 4, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9015979, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2024-06-07 09:41:04"}
